[{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0108","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0108.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-5777","title":"Citrix NetScaler ADC/Gateway 内存信息泄露漏洞","description":"Citrix NetScaler ADC 和 Gateway 的认证接口存在输入验证不足漏洞，当设备配置为 Gateway（VPN 虚拟服务器、ICA 代理、CVPN、RDP 代理）或 AAA 虚拟服务器时，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 `/p/u/doAuthentication.do` 端点发送特制 HTTP 请求触发内存越界读取，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Citrix NetScaler ADC 和 Gateway 14.1 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重。厂商已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-5777"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-06-17T13:15:21Z","updated":"2026-06-17T09:48:43Z","remediation":"立即将受影响 NetScaler ADC/Gateway 升级至 14.1-43.56 或 13.1-58.32 及以上版本（FIPS/NDcPP 版本请联系 Citrix 支持获取对应修复版本）。升级后执行 `kill sessions` 命令清除已有会话，防止攻击者利用已窃取的内存数据持续访问。该漏洞无临时缓解措施，无法通过 WAF 签名或防火墙规则规避，必须升级修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["https://support.citrix.com/support-home/kbsearch/article?articleNumber=CTX693420","https://citrixbleed.com","https://horizon3.ai/attack-research/attack-blogs/cve-2025-5777-citrixbleed-2-write-up-maybe/","https://labs.watchtowr.com/how-much-more-must-we-bleed-citrix-netscaler-memory-disclosure-citrixbleed-2-cve-2025-5777/","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/cisa-tags-citrix-bleed-2-as-exploited-gives-agencies-a-day-to-patch/","https://www.netscaler.com/blog/news/netscaler-critical-security-updates-for-cve-2025-6543-and-cve-2025-5777/","https://www.theregister.com/2025/07/10/cisa_citrixbleed_kev/","https://doublepulsar.com/citrixbleed-2-exploitation-started-mid-june-how-to-spot-it-f3106392aa71","https://reliaquest.com/blog/threat-spotlight-citrix-bleed-2-vulnerability-in-netscaler-adc-gateway-devices/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2025-5777","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/52401","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-5777.yaml","https://github.com/rootxsushant/Citrix-NetScaler-Memory-Leak-CVE-2025-5777","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/2025/CVE-2025-5777.md","https://github.com/PortSwigger/BChecks/blob/7117c5ff8d1d47ca6282020a243b4d3026480ad5/vulnerabilities-CVEd/CVE-2025-5777%20-%20CitrixBleed%202.bcheck","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/a7fcebc1b9e9a88d443be844dae279be54e22ef4/data/2025/CVE-2025-5777-win3zz_CVE-2025-5777.md","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/aaa966adf56b88bf2eba7f47ee24a777c6208719/2025/CVE-2025-5755/CVE-2025-5777.bcheck","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/3f7b36031f03dbbe570abbcfed8c4b66874bb4dc/2025/CVE-2025-5777.json","https://github.com/4ESTSEC/wxvl/blob/26b15b25c2543f872c330110db4ab2967c7c33e0/doc/2025-07/%E5%8E%9F%E5%88%9B%20Paper%20%20CitrixBleed%202%20(CVE-2025-5777)%20%E6%88%90%E5%9B%A0%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90.md","https://github.com/wooluo/nuclei-templates-2025hw/blob/37e9617426e2a696c8c338b15df99abd6294a4eb/CVE-2025-5777.yaml","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/0190a57b50c784bda47a3b9ac049eaf5bb577d6e/doc/2025-07/CVE-2025-5777%EF%BD%9CCitrix%20NetScaler%20ADC%E5%92%8CNetScaler%20Gateway%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E6%B3%84%E6%BC%8F%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%EF%BC%88POC%EF%BC%89.md","https://github.com/cloudflare/cloudflare-docs/blob/368e16ffd3e2fe129ba5fa6b7b6c4ffb42daf854/src/content/changelog/waf/2025-07-21-waf-release.mdx","https://github.com/Shivshantp/CVE-2025-5777-TrendMicro-ApexCentral-RCE/blob/d9523daccc0ce0cbb0c0feb911d4fef2dd1aab05/cve-2025-5777-poc.py","https://github.com/fox-it/citrix-netscaler-triage","https://github.com/win3zz/CVE-2025-5777","https://github.com/bughuntar/CVE-2025-5777","https://github.com/mingshenhk/CitrixBleed-2-CVE-2025-5777-PoC-","https://github.com/Chocapikk/CVE-2025-5777","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-5777"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0108.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0108.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0037","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0037.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-5349","title":"Citrix NetScaler ADC 及 NetScaler Gateway 管理接口访问控制不当漏洞","description":"NetScaler ADC 和 NetScaler Gateway 的管理接口存在不正确的访问控制漏洞（CWE-1284），具有网络访问权限的攻击者可利用 NetScaler 管理接口的权限验证缺陷，绕过访问限制获取未授权访问。该漏洞影响运行特定固件版本的 NetScaler ADC 与 NetScaler Gateway 设备，可能导致敏感信息泄露或系统配置被篡改，CVSS 评分 8.7，危害等级高。Citrix 已发布安全公告并建议用户尽快升级修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.7,"aliases":["CVE-2025-5349"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-06-17T13:15:21Z","updated":"2026-06-17T09:47:44Z","remediation":"升级 NetScaler ADC / Gateway 至以下安全版本：ADC 及 Gateway 14.1 升级至 14.1-43.56 及以上，13.1 升级至 13.1-58.32 及以上；ADC FIPS 12.1 升级至 12.1-55.328，13.1 升级至 13.1-37.235；ADC NDcPP 13.1 升级至 13.1-37.235。如无法立即升级，可在网络层面限制仅可信管理网段访问 NetScaler 管理接口（Management Interface），并启用 IP 白名单或防火墙规则阻断非授权来源。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["https://support.citrix.com/support-home/kbsearch/article?articleNumber=CTX693420","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/2025/CVE-2025-5349.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f8a21b0c30953d5926478bb080c200645e84a23a/2025/CVE-2025-5349.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/a7fcebc1b9e9a88d443be844dae279be54e22ef4/data/2025/CVE-2025-5349-olimpiofreitas_CVE-2025-5349-Scanner.md","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/aaa966adf56b88bf2eba7f47ee24a777c6208719/2025/CVE-2025-5349/README.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/30c3a896d257362f7419b0c772be2f3dd063ccaa/cves/2025/5xxx/CVE-2025-5349.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2025-5349","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/7f9d328c5fbc6b96e5e86ea6c9dab85e4e384533/docs/2025/citrix_cve-2025-5349.toml","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/0d273a0b2821f58c8dfa9e9b4a2ad049f300e8ec/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-5349.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/7614318c7ea4c24f707447d3fff16042945e6e08/2025/5xxx/CVE-2025-5349.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2025/06/GHSA-927h-58v2-fqv5/GHSA-927h-58v2-fqv5.json","https://github.com/olimpiofreitas/CVE-2025-5349-Scanner","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-5349"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0037.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2025/EXP-AVE-2025-0037.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0037.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0141","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0141.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"时空智友企业流程化管控系统文件上传致远程代码执行漏洞","description":"时空智友企业流程化管控系统存在任意文件上传漏洞，攻击者可通过向/formservice接口发送特制POST请求，利用attachment.write服务接口上传任意文件（如JSP Webshell）至服务器，最终获取服务器权限。该漏洞无需身份认证，攻击成本低，危害性大。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["HWPOC-2025-01f4f690"],"sources":["hwpoc","github"],"published":"2025-06-15T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","remediation":"限制对/formservice接口的访问权限，配置Web应用防火墙拦截非法文件上传请求，对上传目录禁用脚本执行权限，及时联系厂商获取安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T11:33:45Z","references":["https://github.com/wudijun/skzy"],"poc_urls":["https://github.com/wudijun/skzy"],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0141.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0415","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0415.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-0913","title":"Go 标准库 os.OpenFile 符号链接处理不一致漏洞","description":"Go 语言标准库 os 包中的 OpenFile 函数在处理 O_CREATE|O_EXCL 标志时存在符号链接处理不一致漏洞（CWE-59）。在 Unix 系统上，当目标路径为悬空符号链接时，OpenFile 不会跟随链接；而在 Windows 系统上，OpenFile 会跟随悬空符号链接并在链接指向的位置创建文件，导致文件创建行为绕过预期安全检查。本地攻击者可通过创建恶意符号链接，诱使高权限程序在非预期位置创建文件，造成完整性破坏。该漏洞影响 Go 语言所有版本，需本地低权限访问且用户无交互即可触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-0913"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-06-11T18:15:24Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:27:21Z","remediation":"升级 Go 至 1.24.4 或更高版本（Go 1.23 系列升级至 1.23.8+），该版本修复了 os.OpenFile 在 Unix 与 Windows 上对 O_CREATE|O_EXCL 与 dangling symlink 处理不一致的问题。如无法立即升级，应避免在涉及符号链接的场景中使用 O_CREATE|O_EXCL 组合标志，并确保应用程序以低权限用户运行以降低影响。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://go.dev/cl/672396","https://go.dev/issue/73702","https://groups.google.com/g/golang-announce/c/ufZ8WpEsA3A","https://pkg.go.dev/vuln/GO-2025-3750","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-0913.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2025/0xxx/CVE-2025-0913.json","https://github.com/envoyproxy/envoy/blob/359861cdad48ead4b4ee1d08680ed509020d2a4e/changelogs/1.35.4.yaml","https://github.com/grafana/mimir/blob/c7e97b4577d676fa695d27579d5eb04b704f58c7/docs/sources/mimir/release-notes/v2.16.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/bb6cd0f1a29580d840cdb570b8b0c57cc39aac6d/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-0913.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2025-0913","https://github.com/balena-os/meta-balena/blob/f953cbe62e7bd00402a5ad083d8a7431a00ec3c4/meta-balena-common/recipes-devtools/go/go-1.24.6.inc","https://github.com/warewulf/warewulf/blob/1a055cc5b4f8db950bb0e3b1c3559c85de4c0e61/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/347fea450bbb600a02904f9eaa5ce5c35747c461/data/2025/CVE-2025-0913.json","https://github.com/DefectDojo/django-DefectDojo/blob/e59faf2d570a27373e95f437c5bed22f87adf46b/unittests/scans/zora/scan_many.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0415.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0025","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0025.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-47165","title":"Microsoft Excel 释放后使用远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Excel 2024 存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free，CWE-416）内存破坏漏洞。当用户打开攻击者精心构造的恶意 Excel 文档时，程序在处理特定对象时未能正确管理内存生命周期，导致已释放内存被再次访问，未经身份认证的远程攻击者借此可在受害者系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Excel 2024 及相关 Office 套件版本，攻击需诱使用户打开特制文件，本地触发代码执行，CVSS 评分为 7.8（高危）。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-47165"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-06-10T17:23:36Z","updated":"2026-06-17T09:27:32Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 官方发布的 CVE-2025-47165 安全更新补丁，可通过 Windows Update 自动获取或访问 Microsoft Update Catalog 手动下载安装。如暂时无法安装补丁，建议在受影响的 Office 应用中禁用宏执行，并启用受保护视图以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-47165","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/52343","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/2025/CVE-2025-47165.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d00c4bdddf18e05c46df568e8ae91e7912ce321c/cves/2025/47xxx/CVE-2025-47165.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/57b2f46f8b4a48cfba3cb8b60306b43a8ab2b242/2025/47xxx/CVE-2025-47165.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-47165","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/3b956963db597dfc3808b14bb6c1e0feecc70f0a/2025/CVE-2025-47165.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/e2c3d33b7e2870449a687c9b1cfa4c48990c946b/docs/2025/%E5%BE%AE%E8%BD%AF_microsoft-excel-2024%E8%BF%9C%E7%A8%8B%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E-cve-2025-47165.toml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2025/06/GHSA-29gg-qvj7-46c7/GHSA-29gg-qvj7-46c7.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/mitre/CVE-2025-47165","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/24512263eb77d6af2cecd67bd2460f