AVE-2025-0014","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0014.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-27505","title":"GeoServer REST API 未授权访问漏洞","description":"GeoServer 开源服务器 REST API 存在授权绕过漏洞。由于 REST API 安全过滤器仅匹配 `/rest` 及其子路径，未正确处理带文件扩展名的请求（如 `/rest.html`），导致攻击者可通过在 REST API 路径后添加扩展名绕过默认安全限制，访问 REST API 索引页面，从而泄露已安装扩展信息。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需认证即可远程利用，影响 GeoServer 2.26.3 之前版本及 2.25.6 之前版本。官方已在 2.26.3 和 2.25.6 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-27505"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-06-10T15:15:23Z","updated":"2026-06-17T09:03:43Z","remediation":"升级 GeoServer 至 2.26.3 或 2.25.6 及以上版本。若无法升级，修改 ${GEOSERVER_DATA_DIR}/security/config.xml，将 rest 过滤器路径改为 /rest.*,/rest/**，将 gwc 过滤器路径改为 /gwc/rest.*,/gwc/rest/**，然后重启 GeoServer 服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/geoserver/geoserver/pull/8170","https://github.com/geoserver/geoserver/security/advisories/GHSA-h86g-x8mm-78m5","https://osgeo-org.atlassian.net/browse/GEOS-11664","https://osgeo-org.atlassian.net/browse/GEOS-11776","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-27505.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/2025/CVE-2025-27505.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/010b0aa4fab18a47a1dfa699acc027ecfea23b55/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-27505.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7481e97cf7b60a5b982d99d7dad1ea61174940fb/cves/2025/27xxx/CVE-2025-27505.json","https://github.com/SourByte05/Vulnerability-Wiki-PoC/blob/887b19465e0912159dcc21abb385b73dcbc283ba/2025/GeoServer-CVE-2025-27505-%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E6%B3%84%E9%9C%B2/GeoServer-CVE-2025-27505-%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E6%B3%84%E9%9C%B2.md","https://github.com/selinuxG/Golin/blob/6354d5fac23ae8d582cb7616fdd290d9deeee5cf/poc/yaml-poc/poc-yaml-GeoServer-CVE-2025-27505.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2025/CVE-2025-27505.rules","https://github.com/iris-sast/iris/blob/3a12f45750f58135bcc58c7fdf4c20786b600e31/data/Dockerfiles/geoserver_CVE-2025-27505_2.26.2/157/Dockerfile","https://github.com/hack007x/veil_poc/blob/5cfe1da6e975ba816d728597885a5c5e79bda8bd/cves/2025/CVE-2025-27505.poc","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/94ba69fdac5ced9eb8795ce09aa042cbb168d31b/2025/27xxx/CVE-2025-27505.json","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/e2c3d33b7e2870449a687c9b1cfa4c48990c946b/docs/2025/geoserver_geoserver-rest-api-%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E6%9C%AA%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83%E8%AE%BF%E9%97%AE%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E-cve-2025-27505.toml","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-27505"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0014.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0014.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0029","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0029.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-49002","title":"飞致云 DataEase Postgresql JDBC 绕过远程代码执行漏洞","description":"飞致云 DataEase 是一款开源商业智能与数据可视化工具。在 2.10.10 之前的版本中，此前针对 CVE-2025-32966 的修复补丁存在缺陷：由于该补丁仅以区分大小写的方式禁止 JDBC 连接串中的 INIT 与 RUNSCRIPT 关键字，攻击者可通过大小写变换（如 Init、runsCRIPT 等）绕过该限制。在具备数据源校验接口（如 /de2api/datasource/validate）访问权限的前提下，攻击者能构造特制的 PostgreSQL JDBC 连接参数，借助 INIT/RUNSCRIPT 执行任意 SQL 或系统命令，从而实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响所有低于 v2.10.10 的 DataEase 版本，CVSS 评分为 8.2（高危），官方已在 2.10.10 版本中修复，暂无其他可用的临时缓解措施。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.2,"aliases":["CVE-2025-49002"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-06-03T21:15:22Z","updated":"2026-06-17T09:30:39Z","remediation":"建议立即将飞致云 DataEase 升级至 v2.10.10 及以上版本，该版本修复了针对 CVE-2025-32966 补丁的绕过问题（因大小写不敏感导致 INIT 和 RUNSCRIPT 被绕过）。升级前可在网络层临时限制对 /de2api/datasource/validate 接口的访问来源，仅允许可信管理网段访问，并关闭公网暴露的数据源校验接口以降低被利用风险。官方未提供其他可用缓解措施，请务必尽快完成版本升级。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/dataease/dataease/security/advisories/GHSA-999m-jv2p-5h34","https://github.com/dataease/dataease/security/advisories/GHSA-h7hj-4j78-cvc7","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-49002.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/2025/CVE-2025-49002.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/d09fb918849614ec417315b66ba20a16a39f16a4/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-49002.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d00c4bdddf18e05c46df568e8ae91e7912ce321c/cves/2025/49xxx/CVE-2025-49002.json","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/0190a57b50c784bda47a3b9ac049eaf5bb577d6e/doc/2026-03/DataEase%20CVE-2025-49002%20RCE.md","https://github.com/SourByte05/Vulnerability-Wiki-PoC/blob/e52a2c3eaf2fb0befc721cf0919d07ea435a23b4/2025/DataEase%202.10.10%20H2%20JDBC%20Bypass%20CVE-2025-49002%20RCE/DataEase%202.10.10%20H2%20JDBC%20Bypass%20CVE-2025-49002%20RCE.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/a7fcebc1b9e9a88d443be844dae279be54e22ef4/data/2025/CVE-2025-49002-jiuzui129-arch_CVE-2025-49002.md","https://github.com/Threekiii/CVE/blob/b15267648d6c329465c8b4cfbeb7597850ead8c1/2025/2025.06/CVE-2025-49002%EF%BC%9ADataease%20H2%20%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93%E8%BF%9C%E7%A8%8B%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E.md","https://github.com/zan8in/afrog/blob/2f4b82909698139f3589d577b113dd4e51dc5c96/pocs/afrog-pocs/CVE/2025/CVE-2025-49002.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/aaa966adf56b88bf2eba7f47ee24a777c6208719/2025/CVE-2025-49002/poc.py","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/87cc3b72f23339a3811f77c4104a170e7f34c37e/2025/49xxx/CVE-2025-49002.json","https://github.com/Feng-Huang-0520/DataEase_Postgresql_JDBC_Bypass-CVE-2025-49002","https://github.com/jiuzui129-arch/CVE-2025-49002","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-49002"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0029.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0028","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0028.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-49001","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"inputTokens\":16716,\"outputTokens\":30,\"totalTokens\":16746}}","description":"飞致云 DataEase 是一款开源商业智能与数据可视化工具，其 2.10.10 之前版本存在 JWT 认证绕过漏洞。由于密钥验证机制未能正确生效，攻击者可伪造任意 JWT 令牌绕过身份认证，进而通过 PostgreSQL JDBC 接口实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响范围广泛，攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互，CVSS 评分 7.7，危害等级高。厂商已在 v2.10.10 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.7,"aliases":["CVE-2025-49001"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-06-03T21:15:22Z","updated":"2026-06-17T09:30:38Z","remediation":"将 DataEase 升级至 v2.10.10 或更高版本，修复 JWT 认证绕过漏洞。如无法立即升级，可通过防火墙限制 DataEase API 接口访问，并部署 WAF 规则过滤伪造 JWT Token 的恶意请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/dataease/dataease/security/advisories/GHSA-xx2m-gmwg-mf3r","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-49001.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/2025/CVE-2025-49001.md","https://github.com/vulhub/vulhub/blob/f7944fe38a3988ee533761e6cdb5e68d67eefff2/dataease/CVE-2025-49001/README.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/d09fb918849614ec417315b66ba20a16a39f16a4/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-49001.yaml","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/Web%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E/DataEase%20JWT%20%E8%AE%A4%E8%AF%81%E7%BB%95%E8%BF%87%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%20CVE-2025-49001.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d00c4bdddf18e05c46df568e8ae91e7912ce321c/cves/2025/49xxx/CVE-2025-49001.json","https://github.com/Threekiii/Vulnerability-Wiki/blob/b32b83c01eabac4d6b4b334852be9cff76ba67ee/docs-base/docs/webapp/DataEase-JWT-%E8%AE%A4%E8%AF%81%E7%BB%95%E8%BF%87%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E-CVE-2025-49001.md","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/0190a57b50c784bda47a3b9ac049eaf5bb577d6e/doc/2025-06/%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%E9%A2%84%E8%AD%A6%20%20DataEase%20JWT%E8%AE%A4%E8%AF%81%E7%BB%95%E8%BF%87%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%EF%BC%88CVE-2025-49001%EF%BC%89.md","https://github.com/wooluo/nuclei-templates-2025hw/blob/37e9617426e2a696c8c338b15df99abd6294a4eb/cve-2025-49001.yaml","https://github.com/zan8in/afrog/blob/2f4b82909698139f3589d577b113dd4e51dc5c96/pocs/afrog-pocs/CVE/2025/CVE-2025-49001.yaml","https://github.com/hack007x/veil_poc/blob/5cfe1da6e975ba816d728597885a5c5e79bda8bd/cves/2025/CVE-2025-49001.poc","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-49001"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0028.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2025/EXP-AVE-2025-0028.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0028.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0023","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0023.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-44148","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1728,\"inputTokens\":9141,\"outputTokens\":20,\"totalTokens\":10889}}","description":"MailEnable 在 v10 之前的版本中存在反射型跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，攻击者可通过向 /Mondo/lang/sys/Failure.aspx 组件的 state 参数中注入恶意 JavaScript 代码触发该漏洞。当用户访问攻击者构造的恶意链接时，所注入的脚本将在用户浏览器上下文中执行，导致攻击者能够窃取会话 Cookie、劫持用户账户、篡改页面内容或执行其他恶意操作。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，影响范围为所有 MailEnable 10 以下版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-44148"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-06-03T16:15:25Z","updated":"2026-07-05T01:21:40Z","remediation":"立即升级 MailEnable 至 v10.00 或更高版本，该版本已修复 failure.aspx 组件中未正确转义用户输入的问题。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器（IIS）层面为 /Mondo/lang/sys/Failure.aspx 路径添加 URL 参数过滤规则，对 state 等参数中的特殊字符（如引号、尖括号）进行编码或拦截，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/barisbaydur/CVE-2025-44148","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-44148.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/2025/CVE-2025-44148.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f8a21b0c30953d5926478bb080c200645e84a23a/2025/CVE-2025-44148.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/010b0aa4fab18a47a1dfa699acc027ecfea23b55/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-44148.yaml","https://github.com/SourByte05/Vulnerability-Wiki-PoC/blob/887b19465e0912159dcc21abb385b73dcbc283ba/2025/MailEnable-CVE-2025-44148-%E5%8F%8D%E5%B0%84XSS/MailEnable-CVE-2025-44148-%E5%8F%8D%E5%B0%84XSS.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/0f1885b9ad0c36bab067e4e3d61739350d154cdf/data/2025/CVE-2025-44148-barisbaydur_CVE-2025-44148.md","https://github.com/wooluo/nuclei-templates-2025hw/blob/37e9617426e2a696c8c338b15df99abd6294a4eb/cve-2025-44148.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2025/CVE-2025-44148.rules","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/aaa966adf56b88bf2eba7f47ee24a777c6208719/2025/CVE-2025-44148/README.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/712a40967986b700313860b08048435be4fa9839/cves/2025/44xxx/CVE-2025-44148.json","https://github.com/hack007x/veil_poc/blob/5cfe1da6e975ba816d728597885a5c5e79bda8bd/cves/2025/CVE-2025-44148.poc","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-44148"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0023.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0163","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0163.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"用友畅捷通T+ GetAll接口敏感信息泄露漏洞","description":"用友畅捷通T+的GetAll接口存在未授权访问漏洞，远程攻击者无需认证即可通过该接口获取系统敏感配置信息、用户数据等，可能导致企业核心数据泄露，危害系统安全。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["HWPOC-2025-024cd43c"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-06-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","remediation":"联系用友官方获取最新安全补丁，升级畅捷通T+至最新版本，对GetAll接口添加访问权限控制，限制非授权IP访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T12:50:58Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0163.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0065","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0065.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"华天动力OA系统BaseHandler文件上传漏洞","description":"华天动力OA系统的/Base/BaseHandler.ashx接口存在文件上传漏洞，攻击者可通过type=uploadFileBase64参数并指定fileSupport=ashx，上传恶意的.ashx文件到服务器。由于系统未对上传文件类型进行充分校验，.ashx文件作为ASP.NET Web Handler可在服务端执行任意代码，导致服务器被完全控制。攻击者无需身份验证即可利用该漏洞，危害严重。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["HWPOC-2025-007963e4"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-06-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","remediation":"限制BaseHandler.ashx接口的上传文件类型，禁止上传.ashx、.aspx等可执行脚本文件；配置IIS上传目录禁止执行权限；升级华天动力OA到最新安全版本或安装厂商提供的安全补丁；部署Web应用防火墙(WAF)拦截恶意文件上传请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T07:06:26Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0065.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0021","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0021.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-4123","title":"Grafana 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Grafana 存在跨站脚本漏洞，由于客户端路径遍历与开放重定向组合不当导致。攻击者无需编辑器权限，可通过特制 URL 将用户重定向至托管恶意前端插件的网站，从而在受害者浏览器中执行任意 JavaScript 代码。若已安装 Grafana Image Renderer 插件，还可利用开放重定向实现完全读取型服务端请求伪造。默认 Content-Security-Policy 的 connect-src 指令可阻止该 XSS 攻击。该漏洞影响多个 Grafana 版本，CVSS 评分 7.6，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.6,"aliases":["CVE-2025-4123"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-05-22T08:15:52Z","updated":"2026-06-17T09:32:33Z","remediation":"立即升级 Grafana 至 v10.4.18+security-01、v11.2.9+security-01、v11.3.6+security-01、v11.4.4+security-01、v11.5.4+security-01、v11.6.1+security-01 或 v12.0.0+security-01 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可禁用匿名访问并在反向代理层限制对 /public/ 路径的路径遍历请求，同时确保 Content-Security-Policy 中 connect-src 指令生效以阻止 XSS 利用。若未使用 Grafana Image Renderer 插件，建议卸载以降低 SSRF 风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["https://grafana.com/blog/2025/05/23/grafana-security-release-medium-and-high-severity-security-fixes-for-cve-2025-4123-and-cve-2025-3580/","https://grafana.com/security/security-advisories/cve-2025-4123/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/52491","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-4123.yaml","https://github.com/ItsNee/Grafana-CVE-2025-4123-POC","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/2025/CVE-2025-4123.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f8a21b0c30953d5926478bb080c200645e84a23a/2025/CVE-2025-4123.json","https://github.com/eeeeeeeeee-code/POC/blob/11c00cc5e129cb7d6ed8a99ef1fc108ae83719b8/wpoc/Grafana/Grafana%E5%AD%98%E5%9C%A8%E6%9C%AA%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83SSRF%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2025-4123).md","https://github.com/zan8in/afrog/blob/2f4b82909698139f3589d577b113dd4e51dc5c96/pocs/afrog-pocs/CVE/2025/CVE-2025-4123.yaml","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/0f1885b9ad0c36bab067e4e3d61739350d154cdf/data/2025/CVE-2025-4123-kk12-30_CVE-2025-4123.md","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/0190a57b50c784bda47a3b9ac049eaf5bb577d6e/doc/2025-06/CVE-2025-4123%EF%BC%9AGrafana%20%E4%B8%AD%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E5%BC%80%E6%94%BE%E9%87%8D%E5%AE%9A%E5%90%91%E5%BC%95%E5%8F%91%E7%9A%84%20XSS.md","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2025/CVE-2025-4123.rules","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/c8de6f2665da1a2cdd26202c7512bf4fd032dd66/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-4123.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/aaa966adf56b88bf2eba7f47ee24a777c6208719/2025/CVE-2025-4123/readme.md","https://github.com/Simpsonpt/AppSecEzine/blob/5f446fcfcccf21c49b6f4258aeb7ced58439d410/Ezines/589%20-%20AppSec%20Ezine","https://github.com/NightBloodZ/CVE-2025-4123","https://github.com/ynsmroztas/CVE-2025-4123-Exploit-Tool-Grafana-","https://github.com/punitdarji/Grafana-cve-2025-4123","https://github.com/MorphyKutay/CVE-2025-4123-Exploit","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-4123"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0021.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0293","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0293.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"管伊佳ERP任意文件上传漏洞","description":"管伊佳ERP系统存在任意文件上传漏洞，攻击者可通过构造特制HTTP请求绕过服务端校验，直接上传恶意WebShell至服务器可写目录，从而获得服务器控制权限，实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响管伊佳ERP多版本，攻击无需身份认证，利用难度低，危害严重。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["HWPOC-2025-0517298a"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-05-17T00:00:00Z","updated":"2025-07-21T00:00:00Z","remediation":"建议在服务器端对上传文件进行严格的白名单后缀校验（仅允许 jpg/png/pdf/doc 等业务必需类型），禁止上传 jsp/php/asp/exe/jar 等可执行脚本文件；同时将上传目录设置为不可执行权限（取消 +x），并对上传文件重命名为随机 UUID 文件名防止路径猜测。如无法立即修复，可在 WAF/反向代理层配置规则拦截包含恶意文件后缀的 POST 请求作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0293.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0024","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0024.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-4679","title":"群晖 Active Backup for Microsoft 365 密钥信息泄露漏洞","description":"群晖 Active Backup for Microsoft 365（ABM）存在凭据泄露漏洞。在 ABM 安装配置过程中，群晖中间件服务 SynoOauth（synooauth.synology.com）在处理 OAuth 授权码回调时，会在 HTTP 302 响应的 Location 头中以明文形式泄露 ABM 全局应用注册的 OAuth client_secret。该密钥属于群晖在其自身 Microsoft 租户中注册的 ABM 多租户应用程序的全局凭据，攻击者仅需观察一次中间件的 HTTP 响应即可获取该密钥。利用泄露的 client_id（b4f234da-3a1a-4f4d-a058-23ed08928904）和 client_secret，攻击者可通过 OAuth 客户端凭证授权流程在任意已部署 ABM 的组织 Microsoft 租户中获取访问令牌，进而以应用权限（Group.Read.All、ChannelMessage.Read.All）读取该租户内所有 Teams 频道消息、群组信息及 Outlook 数据，造成跨组织数据泄露。该漏洞影响所有使用 ABM 的组织，安装量超过 120 万，攻击者无需目标租户内的任何权限即可实施利用，危害范围覆盖不同安全边界。Synology 已在服务端修复此问题，用户无需采取额外措施。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-4679"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-05-16T09:15:18Z","updated":"2026-06-17T09:33:46Z","remediation":"Synology 已在服务端修复该漏洞（旋转了 Active Backup for Microsoft 365 的全局 OAuth 客户端密钥），ABM 作为云托管服务无需用户在 DSM 端执行任何操作。建议用户前往 Microsoft Entra 管理中心审查\"Synology Active Backup for M365\"企业应用程序权限，确认是否仍需保留 Group.Read.All 和 ChannelMessage.Read.All 等高权限，如不再使用 ABM 则移除该服务主体；同时检查 Entra 登录日志中来自 ABM 客户端 ID（b4f234da-3a1a-4f4d-a058-23ed08928904）的异常调用记录，并监控 Microsoft Graph API 活动日志以排查未经授权的 Teams 频道消息和群组数据访问行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.synology.com/en-global/security/advisory/Synology_SA_25_06","https://modzero.com/en/blog/when-backups-open-backdoors-synology-active-backup-m365/","https://modzero.com/static/MZ-25-02_modzero_Synology-Active-Backup-M365.pdf","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/2025/CVE-2025-4679.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f8a21b0c30953d5926478bb080c200645e84a23a/2025/CVE-2025-4679.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/0f1885b9ad0c36bab067e4e3d61739350d154cdf/data/2025/CVE-2025-4679-fevar54_CVE-2025-4679-SecureOAuth-Demo---Enfoque-educativo.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/712a40967986b700313860b08048435be4fa9839/cves/2025/4xxx/CVE-2025-4679.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/mitre/CVE-2025-4679","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/0d273a0b2821f58c8dfa9e9b4a2ad049f300e8ec/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-4679.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/d2626315618f92c3b6f631256244cb094cbffa68/2025/4xxx/CVE-2025-4679.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/cdfc8886d71af7ef3bdab3e4db46753ff8af6538/advisories/unreviewed/2025/05/GHSA-544f-g2r6-4rv9/GHSA-544f-g2r6-4rv9.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2025-4679","https://github.com/kidrek/VigilIntel/blob/cfb2327d8869eaaa4d885703b23a3735545da14f/2025/06/2025-06-30-report.md","https://github.com/fevar54/CVE-2